        372,
        396,
        1289,
        462
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Whereas, The Office will be established under the Police Commissioner pending the completion of the one year review and analysis of City emergency response mechanism by the Mayor's Task Force on Emergency Preparedness; and",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 19,
          "mean": -0.1582,
          "min": -0.9721
        },
        "category": {
